          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Ah, good point. Using the high-usage vehicles will give us better data. I can pull the list from A3 right now. Let's do 3 side-loaders and 2 front-loaders.",
            "mentions": [],
